000001 IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
000002 PROGRAM-ID. IMC.
000003     AUTHOR. Reginaldo Junior.
000003
000004 ENVIRONMENT DIVISION.
000005
000006 DATA DIVISION.
000007
000008 WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
000009
000010 01 ALTURA PIC 9V99 VALUE 0.
000011 01 PESO PIC 999 VALUE 0.
000012 01 IMC_TOTAL PIC ZZ9.99 VALUE 0.
000013 
000014 PROCEDURE DIVISION.
000015 PRINCIPAL.
000016     DISPLAY "Digite sua altura (em metros): ".
000017     ACCEPT ALTURA.
000018     DISPLAY "Digite seu peso (em kg): ".
000019     ACCEPT PESO.
000020 
000021     COMPUTE IMC_TOTAL = PESO / (ALTURA * ALTURA).
000022     DISPLAY "Seu IMC : " IMC_TOTAL.
000023
000024     STOP RUN.
000025 END PROGRAM IMC.
